				<!-- <p class="write_para"><i>Inviteindia.com</i> offers you can create your own online wedding website without technical skills, also you can share with your friends. We work hard to deliver the best possible services for the lowest prices, as profit margins are kept to a bare minimum. Please let us know how we can improve if your experience was less than excellent. Thank you in advance!</p> -->
				<p class="write_para"><i>Inviteindia</i> have created this privacy & policy statement to describe our commitment for your privacy. This page discloses about what type of information we are collecting to create your wedding website, What we do with the information, How do we protect your personal information, Our Payment process information.</p>
				<h3 class="sub_head">Privacy:</h3>
				<h3 class="sub_head_min">What Information We Collect:</h3>
				<p class="write_para">While you utilize the InviteIndia website, InviteIndia collects and stores the following information about you and your computer (the "Basic Information").</p>

				<p class="write_para"><b>1. </b><span class="sub_head_min">The type and version of your Operating System and Web Browser,</span></p>
				<p class="write_para"><b>2. </b><span class="sub_head_min">Your computer's IP address,</span></p>
				<p class="write_para"><b>3. </b><span class="sub_head_min">The date and time of your visit,</span></p>
				<p class="write_para"><b>4. </b><span class="sub_head_min">What page you visited and</span></p>
				<p class="write_para"><b>5. </b><span class="sub_head_min">What page you came from.</span></p>



				<p class="write_para">In addition to the Basic Information, if you have created an account with InviteIndia, we will also collect and store the following information (the "Account Information"):</p>
				<p class="write_para"><b>1. </b><span class="sub_head_min">Your name,</span></p>
				<p class="write_para"><b>2. </b><span class="sub_head_min">Your e-mail address,</span></p>
				<p class="write_para"><b>3. </b><span class="sub_head_min">Data of Birth(Optional).</span></p>

				<p class="write_para">In addition we are storing about your wedding related information, while you're creating wedding website.</p>
				<h3 class="sub_head">What We Do With the Information We Gather:</h3>
				<p class="write_para">We use the information you provide for a variety of purposes, including to better understand your needs and provide you with a better service. In particular, we use the Basic Information and the User Information for the following purposes:</p>
				<p class="write_para"><b>1. </b><span class="sub_head_min">Internal record keeping,</span></p>
				<p class="write_para"><b>2. </b><span class="sub_head_min">To improve our products and services,</span></p>
				<p class="write_para"><b>3. </b><span class="sub_head_min">To send promotional emails about new themes, special offers or other information which we think you may find interesting using the email address which you have provided; and</span></p>
				<p class="write_para"><b>4. </b><span class="sub_head_min">To customize your wedding website according to your interests.</span></p>

				<h3 class="sub_head">How Do We Protect Your Information:</h3>
				<p class="write_para">We are committed to ensuring that your information is secure. In order to prevent unauthorized access or disclosure we have put in place suitable physical, electronic and managerial procedures to safeguard and secure the information we collect online.</p>
				<p class="write_para">In order to secure your personal information, access to your data is password-protected, to the extent supported by your web browser, when it is exchanged between your web browser and the InviteIndia website. Because no security measures are perfect or impenetrable, InviteIndia cannot guarantee that the information submitted to, maintained on or transmitted from its systems will be completely secure.</p>
				<p class="write_para">Finally, you may request access to the information we have collected about you by sending a request to inviteindia.feedback@gmail.com.</p>

				<h3 class="sub_head">Billing and Credit Card Information:</h3>
				<p class="write_para">You can safely and securely enter your credit card number via our secure server, which encrypts all submitted information. We trust the privacy and security of our payment processor Chase Indian payment solutions. Visit <a href="http://www.ccavenue.com" target='_blank'>CC Avenue</a>.</p>

